定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m002-0350","start":350,"end":351,"surface":"閎","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003647","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m002-0353","start":353,"end":354,"surface":"旦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003648","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m002-0356","start":356,"end":357,"surface":"胥","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003649","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang","book_id":"b-shiji-060","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-060-sanwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:p004","text":"三月丙子，奏未央宮。「丞相臣青翟、御史大夫臣湯昧死言：臣謹與列侯臣嬰齊、中二千石二千石臣賀、諫大夫博士臣安等議曰：伏聞周封八百，姬姓并列，奉承天子。康叔以祖考顯，而伯禽以周公立，咸為建國諸侯，以相傅為輔。百官奉憲，各遵其職，而國統備矣。竊以為并建諸侯所以重社稷者，四海諸侯各以其職奉貢祭。支子不得奉祭宗祖，禮也。封建使守藩國，帝王所以扶德施化。陛下奉承天統，明開聖緒，尊賢顯功，興滅繼絕。續蕭文終之後於酂，褒厲群臣平津侯等。昭六親之序，明天施之屬，使諸侯王封君得推私恩分子弟戶邑，錫號尊建百有餘國。而家皇子為列侯，則尊卑相踰，列位失序，不可以垂統於萬世。臣請立臣閎、臣旦、臣胥為諸侯王。」三月丙子，奏未央宮。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m004-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"青翟","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003636","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m004-0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003637","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m004-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"嬰齊","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003643","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m004-0036","start":36,"end":40,"surface":"中二千石","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m004-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"二千石","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、祖先或未定指代；不補未見姓名、成員或確定親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-060-sanwang:m004-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"賀","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003641","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji